  "details": "Managed to recreate the connecting... loop bug last night. It did not recover and got stuck trying to load me into the VRC Home after failing to load my home. I let it try a few times before giving up and restarting my client which ran fine afterwards. A quick look mentions it can't write yt-dlp.exe to the VRC Tools dir. Won't try to speculate why, but that's all that stood out to me.",
